//! | `0x800E7EE0..0x800E9060` | 2 | widget delta and normalised record distance |
//! | `0x800EA7D0..0x800EAE90` | 3 | segment angle/midpoint and the two transform passes |
//! | `0x800EB040..0x800EB930` | 3 | water-full variants, hit test and nearest record |
//! | `0x800EDF70` | 1 | radial-gradient texture bake |
//! | `0x800EE170..0x800EE9B0` | 4 | aspect transform, variant build, retire and list add |
