///   `lfs f0,4(r4)` / `stfs f0,0xFC(r3)`; `lfs f0,8(r4)` /
///   `stfs f0,0x100(r3)`; `stb r5,0x140(r3)`; `stb r6,0x141(r3)`;
///   `stfs f1,0x138(r3)`; `stfs f2,0x134(r3)`; `bl 0x800EAF90`;
///   `mr r3,r30`; `mr r4,r31`; `bl 0x800EB040`; epilogue;
///   `4E800020 bclr 20,0` (blr).
