/// [`F_CONST_61D4`] receive format `0`; all others keep format `0xF`.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_800edf70` at `0x800EDF70` (444 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/800edf70_FUN_800edf70.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `param_1`: image object whose vtable slot `+0x24` receives the buffer.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// One virtual call, four texture calls and `0x80 * 0x80 * 2` texel writes.
///
/// # Safety
/// The vtable and every texture helper must be live and `0x80371C80` must hold
/// the 0x80 x 0x80 destination.
///
/// # Confidence
