/// One record fill, one walk with one write and one byte increment per step, one
/// `0x800F0090` call.
///
/// # Safety
/// `param_2` must be live and the stack record must accept whatever
/// `0x800FB4B0` writes into it (locals live below the saved `r30`/`r31` at
/// `+0x28`, so the record is at most `0x1C` bytes).
