/// record. `// observed:` the table holds Shift-JIS part names
/// (`0x80428A48`..`0x80428A7C`, `0x8031BD80`, `0x8031BD8C`) with ids
/// `2, 15, 26, 4, 3, 6, 7, 8, 14, 16, 17, 18`.
