/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_800f5050` at `0x800F5050` (212 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/800f5050_FUN_800f5050.c`
/// - Extent: `0x800F5050..0x800F5124` (212 bytes)
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `param_1` - object with the `0x18`-byte record array at `+0x15018`.
/// * `param_2` - CSV text base.
/// * `param_3` - pointer to the read cursor.
///
