// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 0x800F5130 - parse one CSV field
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

/// Parses one CSV field and records the `A`/`B`/`C` column flags.
///
/// The body reads the byte at `param_2 + *param_3`. A `"\r\n"` there is an
/// empty line and returns at once. A leading `'"'` both advances the cursor and
/// switches the body into quoted mode (`quoted` is the export's `cVar1 != '"'`
/// test, negated).
