// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 0x800F8B80 - session slot still relevant?
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

/// Tests whether the session's current slot still names a live record.
///
/// The body reads `session + 0x234` and returns `0` when it is negative, when
/// the object does not own that id ([`fn_800f7330`]) or when the sheet marker
