// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 0x800F8E90 - timeout test of the sheet
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

/// Tests whether the sheet has outlived its own timeout.
///
/// When `+0x6E4` is clear the body checks that the session's `+0x230` id names
/// this object ([`FN_800F71C0_B`]) and that the session flag at `+0x18C` is
/// set. In that case it measures the squared distance between the two `+0xAC`
/// triples with `0x801C1650` (result unused), reads the wall clock
/// (`0x802BE470`) and the object's own timeout (vtable slot `+0x78`) and
/// reports `1` once the clock has reached `*(r2 - 0x609C) * timeout`.
