/// `param_2 == 0`, which is the group selector handed to the two accessors.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_800fa6c0` at `0x800FA6C0` (280 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/800fa6c0_FUN_800fa6c0.c`
/// - Removed: the modelled `0x802DCDBC` epilogue call. It is the outlined
///   `_restgpr_26` helper; the record index is returned directly.
