/// * `param_2` - group/type selector; `0` selects the second accessor arm.
/// * `param_3` - the first record index to test.
/// * `param_4` - the record array (`count` at `+0xC`).
///
/// # Returns
/// The matching record index, or `-1`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `param_4` must hold `count` readable 0x1C0-byte records and `param_1` must be
