// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 0x800FA7E0 - ten-byte name search over the active scene block
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

/// Searches the two record groups of the active scene block for a ten-byte
/// name.
///
/// The base is `*(u32 *)(0x8042A18C) + *(i32 *)(scene + 0x338C) * 0x16518 +
