/// - Ghidra: `FUN_800fa9c0` at `0x800FA9C0` (420 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/800fa9c0_FUN_800fa9c0.c`
/// - Removed: the modelled `0x802DCDC0` epilogue call. It is the outlined
///   `_restgpr_27` helper; the code is returned directly.
/// - `// observed:` `bl 0x802dcd74` is `__savegprlr_27`; `lwz r31,0xffffa8fc(r13)`
