///   `lwz r28,0x60(r31)` its three fields; `li r27,9` is the sentinel and
///   `li r27,8` the gate failure; `bl 0x802dcdc0` is `__restgprlr_27`.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `param_1` - row/character index (low byte).
/// * `param_2` - course index (low byte).
/// * `param_3` - section index (low byte), compared with `context[0x44]`.
///
/// # Returns
/// The game-mode code `0..9`, with `9` as the "no mode" sentinel.
///
/// # Side effects
/// One `0x800CE3A0` table read and up to five `0x800FB1xx` bit tests.
///
/// # Safety
/// The context cell must hold a live object and `[0x8042A040]` a live course
/// table covering the two indices.
///
/// # Confidence
