// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 0x800FB670 - unpack the nine-byte code of a table entry
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

/// Copies the nine code bytes at `param_1 + 2` over `param_2` and terminates
/// the result.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_800fb670` at `0x800FB670` (68 bytes)
