/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_800fca20` at `0x800FCA20` (44 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/800fca20_FUN_800fca20.c`
/// - `// observed:` `li r4,0x26` then `bl 0x800FAE40` with `r3` untouched
