///   `stw r31,0xC(r1)`; `mr r31,r3`; `lwz r12,0x2C(r3)`;
///   `lwz r12,0x10(r12)`; `mtctr r12`; `addi r3,r3,0x2C`;
///   `4E800421 bcctrl 20,0` (call); `mr r3,r31`; `bl 0x800E8CC0`; epilogue;
