/// # Side effects
/// One virtual call on the `+0x2C` interface and one transform rebuild per node.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this + 0x2C` must be a live interface object whose vtable has a callable
/// `+0x10` entry, and the node chain must have been built by [`fn_800e8dc0`].
///
