///   `4BF64611 bl 0x80064610`; `li r3,0x253`; `li r4,1`; `li r5,0`;
///   `li r6,0`; `li r7,0`; `4BF645F9 bl 0x80064610`; epilogue;
///   `4E800020 bclr 20,0` (blr).
///
/// # Arguments
