/// Constructs the object whose vtable is [`W287_VT_8031C1E0`].
///
/// Installs the vtable at `+0x00`, placement-constructs the 32-element array of
/// 12-byte records at `+0x04` with element constructor
/// [`W287_FN_80015E30`] and element destructor [`W287_FN_8001FBF0`], then
/// clears the three words `+0x188`, `+0x18C`, `+0x190`.
///
/// # Original (untabled)
/// - Ghidra: none - no `functions.tsv` row and no export file for `0x800FDA50`.
/// - Extent: `0x800FDA50..0x800FDAB8` (104 bytes, 26 words), ending at the
///   `blr` at `0x800FDAB4`; two zero words follow at
