/// # Returns
/// Nothing; the image leaves `r3` from the last call, which no caller reads.
///
/// # Side effects
/// One five-entry scan and one of the two state-entry hooks.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this + 0x6D0..+0x6D8` must be readable; a non-zero `+0x6D0` must point at
/// a record with a readable `+0xD` byte; the vtable at `+0x60` must be live.
///
