/// Resolves one typed entry of a `0x1C`-stride table and returns its point.
///
/// # Original (untabled)
/// - Ghidra: none - no `functions.tsv` row and no export file for `0x800EBAB0`.
/// - Extent: `0x800EBAB0..0x800EBB2C` (124 bytes, 31 words), ending at the
///   `blr` at `0x800EBB28`; one zero word follows at `0x800EBB2C` and the next
///   band body starts at `0x800EBBE0`.
