/// - Observed: `9421FFE0 stwu r1,-0x20(r1)`; `mflr r0`; `stw r0,0x24(r1)`;
///   `1C06001C mulli r0,r6,0x1C`; `stw r31,0x1C(r1)`; `mr r31,r5`;
///   `add r5,r3,r0`; `lbz r0,0x19(r5)`; `cmpl cr0,r7,r0`;
///   `40820040 bc 4,2` (a tag mismatch returns `-1`); `mr r5,r6`;
///   `addi r6,r1,0x10`; `addi r7,r1,0xC`; `addi r8,r1,8`;
///   `bl 0x800EB6E0`; `7C600774 extsb r0,r3`; `cmpi cr0,r0,-1`;
///   `41820020 bc 12,2` (a `0xFF` status returns `-1`); `cmpi cr0,r31,0`;
///   `4182001C bc 12,2` (a null destination skips both stores);
///   `lfs f0,0x10(r1)`; `stfs f0,0(r31)`; `lfs f0,0x14(r1)`;
///   `stfs f0,4(r31)`; `b 0x800EBB18`; the two error arms load `li r3,-1`;
///   epilogue; `blr`.
